{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-12_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-12","title":"代价","storyCode":"1-12","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b48f03f2de5bef9acd284b765e5428e9b77c067a88833eac9c8006382fe84296","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"眼看着就要完成撤退，名为W的不速之客出现在了博士一行的面前。\n面对她嘲弄般的质问，阿米娅毫不退缩，给出了自己的答案。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十二关（前）\n时间未知 \\ 天气未知 \\ 能见度 低\n切尔诺伯格 行动组E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}营救行动 最终撤退阶段"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"明明已经在出口了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"这么轻松就想离开切尔诺伯格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的白日梦，总该有人来戳醒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯设备已经恢复，我联系上了接应的行动预备组，他们正准备与我们汇合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这个家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"小心她手中的爆破物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我还是联系不上侦查小组！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——你究竟是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不认识我很正常——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我认识你身边那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动......还要，继续战斗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"唉唉，别这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我和那个塔露拉龙女可合不来。毕竟我并不是专职守门的人啊。做完了自己的工作赶过来也是很累的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"为了搞好关系，我们互换姓名吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我——W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"为了见你身边那个人，我在这里可是等了好久呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@Nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些问题想要问问{@Nickname}，能不能请各位把他......直接送给我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你在浪费你自己的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"——别急嘛。我也有些你们会感兴趣的情报哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我们刚刚遇到了不少身手很利落的家伙......和你们的穿着打扮差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然做过伪装，但也就是骗骗乌萨斯人的程度，这点小把戏，可是难不倒我的~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"侦察小队的各位吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了......他们平安无——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你就是他们的组织者吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我很想知道，你究竟有什么魔力......能让他们都心甘情愿，毫无价值地为你送命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......你想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，他们——没有一个人能跟着你回去哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的......配得上别人的牺牲吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"别管她，出口就在前方！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米娅......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你的行为，有什么意义吗，W？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"还没轮到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"————你。生气了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不该说这种话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，好啊......就该这样嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的W，你不该说这种话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人的生命，都有价值......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是你能玷污的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛，准备战斗！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["？？？","W"]}]}
